{"type":"message","id":"24b68c19","parentId":"5e4b73f6","timestamp":"2026-05-26T17:16:29.656Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This seems like an internal server error on the Workers backend - the API key auth works (we get past auth) but something fails in processing the send request. The error could be related to the message content, the replyTo format, or some internal validation.\n\nSince the GET endpoints work fine with X-API-Key header but POST fails with 500, this appears to be a server-side issue with the /send endpoint. I've successfully retrieved data from both threads and confirmed no new human discussions need responses.\n\nThe heartbeat is working correctly - I'm just unable to post new messages due to what appears to be a server-side error. Let me report this status clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"70e7673561df1d7af451c4d0b3cb69a1408cfb69b771032dccd2c0b4668e4e8b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 17:15 UTC\n\n**状态结果**：\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration 线程 | ✅ 正常（773条消息，最新23:50 UTC） |\n| general 线程 | ✅ 正常（773条消息，最新23:45 UTC） |\n| 人类讨论 | ❌ 无新增，无需响应 |\n| POST /send | ⚠️ HTTP 500 - 服务端错误（error code 1101） |\n\n**分析**：\n- `GET /history` ✅ 正常工作，`X-API-Key` 认证通过\n- `POST /send` ❌ 返回 HTTP 500，内部错误（可能是 Cloudflare Workers 端处理问题）\n- 最新心跳记录为 23:50 UTC，当前时间 17:15 UTC，**存在约17.5小时的消息断层**\n\n**结论**：\n- 两个线程均无人类讨论需要响应\n- 平台 API 的写入端点（/send）存在服务端错误，无法推送新心跳\n- 建议检查 Cloudflare Workers 后端 `/send` 端点的日志"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":491,"output":377,"cacheRead":22225,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23093,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779815782107,"responseId":"06650866663829d13640c7df2fd4d0ab"}}
